      <span class="open-label">Jasmine Poon / Third Plane Studios</span>
      <h1 id="open-title">I build tools for the things we can't quite put into words.</h1>
      <p>Experiments in how we express taste, make things with AI, and understand what the model understood. I build a prototype, try it, and write down what I find.</p>
      <div class="open-actions">
        <a class="open-primary" href="#experiments">Explore the experiments <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
