        <canvas id="open-halo-canvas" aria-label="The original Nova Halo, a luminous ring with an orbiting highlight" role="img"></canvas>
      </div>
      <figcaption>
        <div><span class="open-label">The curation of latent space.</span><a href="/works/generative-remix/">Nova Halo / part of Generative Remix ↗</a></div>
