        <div class="open-card-content"><span class="open-label">Feb 2026</span><h3>Generative Remix</h3><p>What if AI built the knobs, and you supplied the taste?</p><span class="open-card-action">Explore the prototype ↗</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="open-card" href="/works/taste-score/">
        <div class="open-card-media"><img src="/assets/studio-directions/intent.jpg" alt="Intent Configuration Interface showing an editable preference score" width="800" height="486"><span class="open-badge" data-type="prototype">Prototype</span></div>
        <div class="open-card-content"><span class="open-label">Mar 2026</span><h3>Intent Configuration Interface</h3><p>What if you could edit what the model thought you meant?</p><span class="open-card-action">Inspect the interpretation ↗</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="open-card" href="/works/holovibes/">
        <div class="open-card-media"><img src="/assets/studio-directions/holovibes.jpg" alt="Holovibes material playground with a holographic street scene" width="900" height="547"><span class="open-badge" data-type="generative">Material study</span></div>
        <div class="open-card-content"><span class="open-label">Aug 2026</span><h3>Holovibes</h3><p>How much of a physical surface's pleasure can live on a screen?</p><span class="open-card-action">Explore the material ↗</span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="open-notes container" id="notes" aria-labelledby="open-notes-title">
    <div class="open-section-heading"><div><span class="open-label">Field notes</span><h2 id="open-notes-title">What the experiments leave behind.</h2></div></div>
    <div class="open-notes-grid">
      <a class="open-research" href="/works/model-internals-research/">
        <span class="open-label">Research pilot / June 2026</span>
        <h3>Steering an image model toward a quality: show not tell</h3>
        <p>A one-week pilot asked whether a visual quality could become a dependable control. It didn't establish that control. The gap between human and AI judgment became the next question.</p>
        <span class="open-card-action">Read the experiment and its limits ↗</span>
      </a>
      <div class="open-fragment">
        <span class="open-label">From Generative Remix</span>
        <blockquote>“Most people can recognize taste but can't articulate it.”</blockquote>
        <p>The question that connects the work: how can an interface make that recognition useful?</p>
        <a href="/works/generative-remix/#the-thesis">Read the thinking behind it ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="open-about container" aria-label="About the studio">
    <span class="open-label">An ongoing practice</span>
    <p>I'm Jasmine. Third Plane Studios is where I build, test, and write about these ideas—from small visual experiments to questions about how we evaluate AI.</p>
    <a href="/labs/">Current evaluation work at Thirdplane Labs ↗</a>
  </section>
